{% comment %}
  Oberndoerfer Milano - REDESIGN 2026 site-wide touches (draft theme only; sits in the header group so
  it loads on every page):
  - the type, as on gallerydept.com (owner, 7 October: "i love all of the fonts of this website, can you
    take the same"): Courier New for text, menus, product names and prices, Helvetica for headings.
    Both are system fonts, so nothing is copied; phones without Courier New (Android) get Courier
    Prime, a free Courier cut (SIL Open Font Licence) from Google Fonts;
  - square colour chips and square buttons on product pages, as on Bottega Veneta's product page;
  - the header, as on Bottega Veneta: on a phone the menu icon left, logo centred, "Cart" right; on a
    desktop the word "Menu" left (it opens the menu panel from obm-mobile-menu-2026), the logo centred
    and "Search", "Login" and "Cart" as words at the right.
{% endcomment %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Courier+Prime:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --obm-font-text: 'Courier New', 'Courier Prime', Courier, monospace;
    --obm-font-display: Helvetica, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-body--family: var(--obm-font-text);
    --font-subheading--family: var(--obm-font-text);
    --font-accent--family: var(--obm-font-text);
    --font-heading--family: var(--obm-font-display);
    --font-heading--weight: 700;
    --font-heading--style: normal;
  }
</style>
{%- comment -%}
  Price upon request (owner, 7 October: "put all of the sofas price upon request"). Products tagged
  price-on-request show "Price upon request" (snippets/price.liquid) and, on their product page, an
  Enquire button in place of the cart buttons, to the contact page, with the e-mail as a second way.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if template.name == 'product' and product.tags contains 'price-on-request' -%}
  <style>
    .buy-buttons-block product-form-component { display: none !important; }
    .obm-enquire { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .obm-enquire__button { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: 14px 20px; border: 1px solid #1c1714; border-radius: 0; background: #1c1714; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color .25s ease, color .25s ease; }
    .obm-enquire__button:hover { background: #fff; color: #1c1714; }
    .obm-enquire__note { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #6b625b; }
    .obm-enquire__note a { color: inherit; }
  </style>
  <template id="ObmEnquireTpl">
    <div class="obm-enquire">
      <a class="obm-enquire__button" href="{{ pages['contact'].url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Enquire</a>
      <p class="obm-enquire__note">Made by hand to order. Write to us for the price, the leathers and the lead time, or e-mail <a href="mailto:info@oberndoerferco.com?subject={{ 'Enquiry: ' | append: product.title | url_escape }}">info@oberndoerferco.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </template>
  <script>
    (function () {
      function place() {
        var tpl = document.getElementById('ObmEnquireTpl'); if (!tpl) return;
        document.querySelectorAll('.buy-buttons-block').forEach(function (b) {
          if (b.querySelector('.obm-enquire')) return;
          b.appendChild(tpl.content.cloneNode(true));
        });
      }
      if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', place); else place();
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}
{% stylesheet %}
  .ob-pdp-swatch { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 0; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(24, 18, 12, 0.12); }
  .ob-pdp-swatch[aria-current='true'] { box-shadow: none; outline: 1px solid #1c1714; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .product-details .button,
  .product-details button[type='submit'],
  .product-details .quantity-selector,
  .product-details .variant-option__button-label { border-radius: 0 !important; }
  .shopify-section[id*='product_recommendations'] .text-block { margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; }
  .shopify-section[id*='product_recommendations'] .text-block > * { font-family: var(--obm-font-display); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) { .shopify-section[id*='product_recommendations'] .text-block > * { font-size: 20px; } }
  /* Desktop header as on Bottega Veneta (owner, 7 October, "do the same for my desktop"): the word
     "Menu" at the left, the logo centred, Search, Login and Cart as words at the right. The menu bar
     itself is hidden: its links live in the menu panel. */
  .obm-desk-menu, .obm-desk-login { display: none; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .header__row--top .header__columns { display: grid !important; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) !important; grid-template-areas: none !important; align-items: center !important; column-gap: 24px !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__column--center { display: none !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__column--left { grid-column: 2 !important; grid-row: 1 !important; justify-self: center !important; justify-content: center !important; width: auto !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__column--right { grid-column: 3 !important; grid-row: 1 !important; justify-self: end !important; width: auto !important; gap: 32px !important; }
    .header__row--top .header-logo__image { width: auto !important; height: 34px !important; }
    .obm-desk-menu { display: inline-flex; grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; justify-self: start; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .obm-desk-menu, .obm-desk-login,
    .header__row--top .search-action .svg-wrapper::before,
    .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .svg-wrapper::before { font-family: var(--obm-font-text); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1c1714; text-decoration: none; }
    .obm-desk-menu:hover, .obm-desk-login:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
    .obm-desk-login { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; }
    .header__row--top header-actions { display: flex !important; align-items: center; gap: 32px; margin-left: 32px !important; }
    .header__row--top .obm-desk-login { line-height: 1; padding-top: 1px; }
    .header__row--top header-actions .account-button { display: none !important; }
    .header__row--top .search-action .header-actions__action, .header__row--top header-actions .header-actions__action { width: auto !important; min-width: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }
    .header__row--top .search-action .svg-wrapper { width: auto !important; height: auto !important; }
    .header__row--top .search-action .svg-wrapper svg { display: none !important; }
    .header__row--top .search-action .svg-wrapper::before { content: 'Search'; }
  }
  /* "Cart" as a word, with the count in brackets, on every screen size. */
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon { display: flex !important; align-items: center; gap: 4px; width: auto !important; line-height: 1; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .svg-wrapper { width: auto !important; height: auto !important; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .svg-wrapper svg { display: none !important; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .svg-wrapper::before { content: 'Cart'; font-family: var(--obm-font-text); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1c1714; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .cart-bubble:not(.visually-hidden) { position: static !important; inset: auto !important; width: auto !important; height: auto !important; min-width: 0 !important; transform: none !important; background: none !important; color: #1c1714 !important; font-size: 14px !important; padding: 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center; line-height: 1 !important; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .cart-bubble:not(.visually-hidden) .cart-bubble__background { display: none !important; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .cart-bubble:not(.visually-hidden) .cart-bubble__text { position: static !important; font-family: var(--obm-font-text); font-size: 14px !important; line-height: 1 !important; font-weight: 400 !important; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #1c1714 !important; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .cart-bubble:not(.visually-hidden) .cart-bubble__text::before { content: '('; }
  .header__row--top .header-actions__cart-icon .cart-bubble:not(.visually-hidden) .cart-bubble__text::after { content: ')'; }
  /* Phone header (owner, 5 October): the menu icon at the left, the logo in the middle and the word
     "Cart" at the right. Search and account move into the full-screen menu, which has both. The cart
     count, when there is one, follows the word in brackets. */
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .header__row--top .header__columns { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) !important; grid-template-areas: "obmdrawer obmlogo obmactions" !important; column-gap: 8px !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__columns .header__drawer { grid-area: obmdrawer !important; justify-self: start !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__columns .header-logo { grid-area: obmlogo !important; justify-self: center !important; margin: 0 !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__columns header-actions { grid-area: obmactions !important; justify-self: end !important; margin: 0 !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__columns search-button.search-action--hidden-on-menu,
    .header__row--top .header__columns header-actions .account-button { display: none !important; }
    .header__row--top .header__columns header-actions .header-actions__action { width: auto !important; min-width: 44px !important; padding: 0 !important; justify-content: flex-end; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
{% schema %}
{ "name": "Site style (2026)", "settings": [], "presets": [ { "name": "Site style (2026)" } ] }
{% endschema %}
